    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107572" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερθέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>run beyond,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. ἄκραν</span>
			<i>double</i> the headland, prov. of escaping from danger, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				562
			</span></i> (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				230
			</span></i> (anap.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>outstrip, surpass, outdo,</i> [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ] τύχη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					195
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύναμιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					648e
				</span></i>
			; <i>transcend,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ καλόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					6.9.11
				</span></i>
			.</div>
